    "text": "W\u00e6terfatu \u00e6fter Iudea gecl\u00e6nsunge, \u00e6lc w\u00e6s on twegra sestra gemete o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00fereora.\n\u00dea bead se H\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t hig \u00fea fatu mid w\u00e6tere gefyldon and hi gefyldon \u00f0a o\u00f0 \u00f0one brerd.\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lynd, hlada\u00f0 nu and bera\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re drihte ealdre; And hi namon.\n\u00dea se drihte ealdor \u00f0\u00e6s wines on byrgde \u00f0e of \u00feam w\u00e6tere geworden w\u00e6s he nyste hwanon hyt com;\n\u00deis w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t forme tacn \u00f0e se H\u00e6lynd worhte on Chanaan Galile\u00eb and geswutelode hys wuldor and\n\u00c6fter \u00f0ison he and hys modor and hys gebro\u00f0ru and hys leorningcnihtas foron to Capharnaum and\nAnd hyt w\u00e6s neah Iudea eastron and se H\u00e6lynd for to Ierusalem.\nAnd gemette on \u00feam temple \u00f0a \u00f0e sealdon oxan and sceap and culfran and sittende myneteras.\nAnd he worhte swipan of strengon and hi ealle of \u00feam temple adraf ge sceap ge oxan and he ageat\nNe wyrce ge mines F\u00e6der hus to mangunghuse.\n\u00d0a gemundon hys leorningcnih awriten ys, \u00feines huses anda me.\nHim \u00fea Iudeas and cw\u00e6don, hwylc ta for\u00f0am \u00fee \u00f0u \u00feas \u00f0ing dest ?\nSe H\u00e6lynd him andswarude and cw\u00e6\u00f0, towurpa\u00f0 \u00feis templ and ic hyt ar\u00e6re binnan \u00ferim dagon.\n\u00dea Iudeas cw\u00e6don to him, \u00f0is templ w\u00e6s getimbrod on syx and feowertigon wintron and ar\u00e6rst \u00feu\nSo\u00f0lice he hyt cw\u00e6\u00f0 be hys lichaman temple.\n\u00dea he of dea\u00f0e aras \u00f0a gemundon hys leorningcnihtas \u00fe\u00e6t he hyt be him sylfum cw\u00e6\u00f0 and hi\n\u00d0a he w\u00e6s on Ierusalem on eastron on freolsd\u00e6ge manega gelyfdon on hys naman \u00f0a hi gesawon \u00fea\nSe H\u00e6lynd ne geswutelode hyne sylfne him for\u00feam he cu\u00f0e hi ealle and for\u00feam him n\u00e6s nan \u00f0earf\nSo\u00f0lice sum Phariseisc man w\u00e6s genemned Nichodem