\nSo\u00f0lice o\u00f0re d\u00e6g seo menegeo \u00f0e stod begeondan \u00feam mere geseah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6r n\u00e6s buton an scip and\nO\u00f0re scipu comun fram Tiberiade wi\u00f0 \u00fea stowe \u00f0\u00e6r hi \u00feone hlaf \u00e6ton Drihtne \u00f0anciende.\n\u00dea seo menego geseah \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lynd \u00f0\u00e6r n\u00e6s ne hys leorningcnihtas \u00f0a eodon hi on scipu and\nSe H\u00e6lynd him andswarode and cw\u00e6\u00f0, so\u00f0 ic secge eow ne sece ge me for\u00feam \u00f0e ge tacnu gesawon\nNe wyrca\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00feam mete \u00f0e forwyr\u00f0 ac \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00f0e \u00feurhwuna\u00f0 on ece lif \u00f0one mannes sunu eow\nHi cw\u00e6don to him, hw\u00e6t do we \u00fe\u00e6t we wyrceon Godes weorc?\n\u00d0a andswarode se H\u00e6lynd and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, \u00fe\u00e6t ys Godes weorc \u00fe\u00e6t ge gelyfon on \u00f0one \u00f0e he\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don hig, hw\u00e6t dest \u00f0u to tacne \u00fe\u00e6t we geseon and gelyfon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u hyt wyrce?\nF\u00e6deras \u00e6ton heofonlicne mete on westene swa awriten ys, he sealde him etan hlaf of heofone.\nSe cw\u00e6\u00f0 him, secge eow ne sealde Moyses eow hlaf of heofonum ac min F\u00e6der eow syl\u00f0 so\u00f0ne hlaf\nHyt ys Godes hlaf \u00f0e of heofonan com and syl\u00f0 middanearde lif.\nHig cw\u00e6don to him, Drihten, syle us \u00f0isne hlaf.\nSe H\u00e6lynd cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Ic eom lifes hlaf.\nNe hingra\u00f0 \u00feone \u00f0e to me cym\u00f0 and ne \u00f0yrst \u00feone n\u00e6fre \u00f0e on me gelyf\u00f0.\nAc ic eow s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t ge gesawon me and ne gelyfdon.\nEall \u00f0\u00e6t F\u00e6der me syl\u00f0 cym\u00f0 to me and ic ne wurpe ut \u00feone \u00f0e to me cym\u00f0 for\u00feam \u00f0e ic ne com of\n\u00de\u00e6t ys \u00f0\u00e6s F\u00e6der willa \u00f0e me sende \u00fe\u00e6t ic nan \u00f0ing ne forleose of \u00feam \u00fee he me sealde ac awecce\n\u00deis ys mines F\u00e6der willa \u00fee me sende \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc \u00f